quantity-arm-angle = Arm angle (down positive)
quantity-condition-number = Condition number of the Jacobian
quantity-plate-slide = Slide of the plate parts against each other
quantity-amplifier-twist = Twist of the amplifier at the tool
group-kinematics = Kinematics
