group-tool = Tool
effect-joint_elasticity = Gearbox elasticity (off: rigid model)
effect-forearm_inertia = Forearms as rigid rods with their inertia and spin (off: lumped at elbow and plate)
effect-hard_stops = Stops at the ends of the arms' angle range
