param-base_radius_m = Base radius (centre to shoulder axis)
param-plate_radius_m = Plate part radius (part centre to forearm pair)
param-upper_arm_m = Upper arm length
param-forearm_m = Forearm length
param-forearm_spacing_m = Distance of the two rods of a forearm pair (view only)
param-radius_m = Radius
param-top_z_m = Top, height below the shoulder plane
param-height_edge_m = Height at the edge
param-height_centre_m = Height at the centre
param-max_condition_number = Highest condition number of the Jacobian
param-upper_arm_kg = Upper arm mass
param-upper_arm_cg_m = Upper arm centre of mass from the joint
param-upper_arm_inertia_kgm2 = Upper arm inertia about the joint
param-elbow_kg = Elbow mass
param-forearm_pair_kg = Forearm pair mass
param-forearm_elbow_share = Share of a forearm pair's mass at the elbow
param-forearm_rod_spin_inertia_kgm2 = Each forearm rod's inertia about its own axis
param-plate_part_kg = Mass of each plate part
param-carriage_kg = Mass of the carriage (pinion, gear stage, flange)
param-pinion_radius_m = Pitch radius of the pinion between the racks
param-gear_ratio = Ratio of the gear stage behind the pinion
param-amplifier_stiffness_nm_rad = Torsional stiffness of the amplifier at the tool
param-amplifier_damping_nm_s_rad = Torsional damping of the amplifier at the tool
param-amplifier_backlash_rad = Backlash of the amplifier at the tool
param-inertia_kgm2 = Tool's inertia about its axis
param-payload_inertia_kgm2 = Payload's inertia about the tool's axis
param-max_velocity_rad_s = Highest speed [rad/s]
param-max_acceleration_rad_s2 = Highest acceleration [rad/s²]
param-max_jerk_rad_s3 = Highest jerk [rad/s³]
error-delta-outside-envelope = The target lies outside the working range.
error-delta-out-of-reach = The arms cannot reach the target.
error-delta-joint-stop = An arm would have to go beyond its stop for the target.
error-delta-singularity = The target lies too near a singularity of the kinematics.
